OL,3,GNEWSAThe rare guitar that starred on
OL,4,AU2's defining album
OL,5,
OL,6,FU2 released their 16th studio album
OL,7,Fthis week, titled Carnaval de Luz, but
OL,8,Flong-term fans will know it was their
OL,9,Ffifth album that cemented their iconic
OL,10,Fstatus as one of the world's biggest
OL,11,Frock bands.
OL,13,FReleased in 1987, The Joshua Tree
OL,14,Fbecame the Irish band's best-selling
OL,15,Falbum, with more than 25 million copies
OL,16,Fsold around the world, and a Grammy
OL,17,FAward for Album of the Year in 1988.
OL,19,FIt was on that record that lead
OL,20,Fguitarist the Edge played a rare and
OL,21,Funique version of the instrument that
OL,22,Fwas designed and made in Poole, Dorset.
